blocks.text:
Har tangent ya normal wale sawal ka ek hi plan hai, ise zehan mein bitha lijiye:
1. curve par point \((x_0, y_0)\) nikalo (\(x_0\) ko curve ki equation mein rakh kar \(y_0\));
2. \(\frac{dy}{dx}\) nikalo aur us mein \(x = x_0\) rakh kar slope \(m\) lo;
3. point-slope form mein line likh do.
Misaal ke taur par socho ke aap ek pahari sarak par gaari chala rahe hain. Kisi bhi lamhe gaari ki headlights jis seedhi line mein roshni daalti hain, woh us jagah sarak ki tangent hai. Aur sarak ke kinare lage hue khambe (pole) jo sarak se bilkul 90 degree par khare hon, woh normal ki tarah hain.
